    excerpt="Exposes common pitfalls and limitations of insurance options for nomads, revealing what insurance companies don't tell you and how to protect yourself while traveling long-term. Christoph breaks down the fine print, coverage gaps, and hidden exclusions that could leave nomads vulnerable when they need protection most."
  />
</Layout>

